# YouTube Data API v3 key (server-side-style key, browser-safe enough for a client project).
# Required to lift the 200-video playlist cap (the IFrame player API only loads ~200 videos).
# When omitted, playlists load via the built-in player path (existing behavior).
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials, then enable:
#   YouTube Data API v3  (for the current project)
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=